# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# R3 DEVELOPMENT LOOP
# release -> test -> comments -> core dump -> review -> plan -> build -> release
# This layer is intentionally injected by the builder so the generated HTML is
# still the complete standalone game.  When served by rct_r3_dev_server.py it
# also persists comments/dumps directly to disk; file:// mode falls back to
# browser downloads/localStorage.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
